<title>UK: ICI hits eight-month high on U.S. buying.</title>
<headline>ICI hits eight-month high on U.S. buying.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in Imperial Chemical Industries Plc rose to an eight-month high in early trade on Friday, boosted by a sharp rise in its ADRs in the U.S., dealers said.</p>
<p>The shares were up 11-1/2p to 871p by 0815 GMT, after briefly touching 874-1/2p, its best level since October 2, 1996.</p>
</text>
